  ["WIND"] = "窓",
  ["Wait for every cook to finish before closing the kitchen. Which JoinHandle method blocks until the thread ends?"] = "厨房を閉める前に、料理人全員が終わるのを待つ。スレッドが終わるまでブロックする JoinHandle のメソッドは？",
  ["Wait for the tea thread and take its result. Which method?"] = "お茶のスレッドを待って結果を受け取る。メソッドは？",
  ["Wait on muffin or hash brown, whichever is ready. Which keyword?"] = "マフィンかハッシュブラウン、先に準備できた方を待つ。キーワードは？",
  ["Wait then close(results) in a goroutine: the receiver's range ends cleanly. No leaks."] = "goroutine 内で Wait してから close(results): 受信側の range がきれいに終わる。リークなし。",
  ["Wait until both cooks call Done. Fill: var wg sync.___"] = "両方のコックが Done を呼ぶまで待つ。埋めて：var wg sync.___",
  ["WaitGroup.Add(n), Done(), Wait(). The tray leaves when n hits zero."] = "WaitGroup.Add(n)、Done()、Wait()。n がゼロになるとトレイが出ます。",
  ["Walk every shop name in a slice. Fill: for _, name := ___ shops"] = "slice の店名を全部たどる。埋める: for _, name := ___ shops",
  ["Walk over a Vec by reference, no index. Which method starts the iterator?"] = "Vec を参照で歩く、インデックスなし。イテレータを始めるメソッドは？",
  ["Walking by reference: no clone, no take, nothing moves. node is &Box<ListNode>, auto-deref reaches next."] = "参照で歩く: clone もなし、take もなし、何もムーブしない。node は &Box<ListNode> で、自動デリファレンスが next に届く。",
  ["Warm the grill exactly once, however many cooks call it. Fill: var once sync.___"] = "何人のコックが呼んでもグリルの予熱は一度だけ。埋めて：var once sync.___",
  ["Was the key there? The second result is a bool named ___."] = "キーはあった？ 2つ目の結果は ___ という名前の bool。",
  ["We already checked mid, so skip past it. hi = mid keeps the half-open rule."] = "mid は確認済みなので飛ばす。hi = mid で半開区間の規則を保ちます。",
  ["Welcome to CODE RUSH! Round one: factorial, then fib without the exponential blowup. Buzzer's live!"] = "CODE RUSH へようこそ！第 1 ラウンド: 階乗、次は指数爆発しない fib。ブザー、オン！",
  ["What goes between the parameter list and the return type u32?"] = "引数リストと戻り値の型 u32 の間に入るものは？",
  ["What is the lightweight thread go starts called?"] = "go が起動する軽量スレッドの名前は？",
  ["When fast runs out, slow stands in the middle. O(n) time, O(1) space, and Option<&T> is Copy so the hops are free. Combo x4."] = "fast が尽きたとき、slow は中央に立っている。時間 O(n)、空間 O(1)、Option<&T> は Copy なので跳躍はタダ。コンボ x4。",
  ["Which Cargo.toml section lists the crates the project uses?"] = "プロジェクトが使うクレートを並べる Cargo.toml のセクションは？",
  ["Which keyword binds a name to a value in Rust?"] = "Rust で名前を値に束縛するキーワードは？",
  ["Which keyword brings HashMap from the standard library into this file?"] = "標準ライブラリの HashMap をこのファイルに持ち込むキーワードは？",
  ["Which keyword declares a function in Rust?"] = "Rust で関数を宣言するキーワードは？",
  ["Which keyword declares a set of methods that types can promise?"] = "型が約束できるメソッドの集まりを宣言するキーワードは？",
  ["Which method returns 9 for the three characters of 銅鑼灣?"] = "銅鑼灣 の3文字に対して 9 を返すメソッドは？",
  ["Which placeholder inside the string prints the value of n?"] = "文字列の中で n の値を出力するプレースホルダーは？",
  ["Which standard package prints to the terminal?"] = "ターミナルに出力する標準packageはどれですか？",
  ["Which std trait, with an empty body, makes OrderError a real error?"] = "空の本体で OrderError を本物のエラーにする std のトレイトは？",
  ["With, then the word for a time limit. WithDeadline takes a clock time instead."] = "With の後に制限時間を表す単語。WithDeadline は代わりに時刻を取ります。",
  ["WithTimeout returns a child that cancels itself. Always defer cancel() or you leak."] = "WithTimeout は自らキャンセルする子を返します。必ず defer cancel() を、さもないとリークします。",
  ["Word count. New word: start at 0. Seen word: bump it. One entry call does both. Fill: entry(w).___(0)"] = "単語数。新しい単語なら 0 から。見たことがある単語なら増やす。entry の呼び出し 1 つで両方できる。埋めて: entry(w).___(0)",
  ["Worker pool and pipeline"] = "worker pool とパイプライン",
  ["Worker pool with threads"] = "スレッドによるワーカープール",
  ["Worker pool: N goroutines range over a jobs channel; close(jobs) ends them; WaitGroup then close(results)."] = "worker pool: N 個の goroutine が jobs channel を range; close(jobs) で終了; WaitGroup の後 close(results)。",
  ["Worker pool: an mpsc channel of jobs, the Receiver in Arc<Mutex<>>, N thread::spawn workers looping on recv. drop(tx) ends them, join waits."] = "ワーカープール: ジョブを流す mpsc チャネル、Arc<Mutex<>> に入れた Receiver、recv をループする N 個の thread::spawn ワーカー。drop(tx) で終わらせ、join で待つ。",
  ["Workers are identical goroutines sharing one input channel. The channel is the queue."] = "worker は 1 つの入力 channel を共有する同一の goroutine。channel がキューです。",
  ["Works on slices, strings, maps, channels. cap is the capacity."] = "slice、string、map、channel に使えます。cap は容量です。",
  ["Write the reply into w, not the terminal. Which fmt function?"] = "返信をターミナルではなく w に書きます。fmt のどの関数？",
  ["You only need a bool: is the order in one of two states? Which macro?"] = "欲しいのは bool だけ: 注文は2つの状態のどちらかにあるか？ どのマクロ？",
  ["You still want the position of every dish on the ticket. Which adapter adds it?"] = "伝票の各料理の位置はやはり欲しい。それを足すアダプタは？",
  ["[0i32; 26] lives on the stack: no HashMap, no allocation. Add for a, subtract for b, all zero means anagram."] = "[0i32; 26] はスタックに置かれる: HashMap もなし、確保もなし。a で足し、b で引き、全部ゼロならアナグラム。",
  ["[3]string is an array: a value, fixed length, copied on assignment. []string is a slice."] = "[3]string は配列: 値型、固定長、代入でコピー。[]string は slice。",
  ["[T any] is the widest constraint. comparable is for map keys."] = "[T any] が最も広い制約。comparable は map のキー用です。",
  ["[]int is a slice. [3]int is an array of three. Slices are what you use."] = "[]int は slice。[3]int は要素3つの配列。普段使うのは slice です。",
  ["[]rune(s) once, then index freely. Interviewers check this in Go."] = "[]rune(s) を一度、あとは自由にインデックス。Go の面接で必ず見られます。",
  ["[dependencies] asks for versions; Cargo.lock records the exact ones. Commit the lock for binaries."] = "[dependencies] はバージョンを要求し、Cargo.lock は正確な値を記録する。バイナリなら lock をコミットする。",
  ["[i32; 3] lives on the stack and never grows. Vec is for lists that change size."] = "[i32; 3] はスタック上にあり、決して伸びない。サイズが変わるリストには Vec。",
  ['[package]\nname = "delivery"\nedition = "2021"\n\n[___]\nserde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }\ntokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }\n'] = '[package]\nname = "delivery"\nedition = "2021"\n\n[___]\nserde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }\ntokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }\n',
  ["_ matches anything and binds nothing. Without it the match is not exhaustive and will not compile. The gate shows set."] = "_ は何にでもマッチし、何も束縛しない。これがないと match は網羅的でなくコンパイルできない。ゲートに set が表示される。",
  ["_ means I know this exists and I am ignoring it on purpose."] = "_ は「存在は知っているが、わざと無視する」という意味です。",
  ['___ OPEN: u8 = 7;        // hour the Express opens\n\nfn main() {\n    println!("opens at {}", OPEN);\n}\n'] = '___ OPEN: u8 = 7;        // Express が開く時刻\n\nfn main() {\n    println!("opens at {}", OPEN);\n}\n',
  ['___ Order {\n    item: String,\n    qty: u32,\n}\nlet o = Order { item: "muffin".to_string(), qty: 2 };\n'] = '___ Order {\n    item: String,\n    qty: u32,\n}\nlet o = Order { item: "muffin".to_string(), qty: 2 };\n',
  ["___ Size { Small, Large }\n\nlet size = Size::Large;\nlet extra = match size {\n    Size::Small => 0,\n    Size::Large => 5,       // every variant handled\n};\n"] = "___ Size { Small, Large }\n\nlet size = Size::Large;\nlet extra = match size {\n    Size::Small => 0,\n    Size::Large => 5,       // すべてのバリアントを処理\n};\n",
  ['___ fry("hashbrown")\n___ toast("muffin")\n'] = '___ fry("hashbrown")\n___ toast("muffin")\n',
  ['___ greet() {\n    println!("welcome to Lucky Mac Express");\n}\n// no arrow: this one returns the unit type ()\n'] = '___ greet() {\n    println!("welcome to Lucky Mac Express");\n}\n// 矢印なし: これは unit 型 () を返す\n',
  ["___ luckymac/delivery\n\ngo 1.22\n\nrequire github.com/lib/pq v1.10.9\n"] = "___ luckymac/delivery\n\ngo 1.22\n\nrequire github.com/lib/pq v1.10.9\n",
  ['___ std::collections::HashMap;\n\nfn main() {\n    let mut stock = HashMap::new();\n    stock.insert("muffin", 4);\n}\n'] = '___ std::collections::HashMap;\n\nfn main() {\n    let mut stock = HashMap::new();\n    stock.insert("muffin", 4);\n}\n',
  ["___ tap(card string) bool {\n    return true\n}\n"] = "___ tap(card string) bool {\n    return true\n}\n",
  ["___ {\ncase m := <-muffin:\n    serve(m)\ncase h := <-hash:\n    serve(h)\n}\n"] = "___ {\ncase m := <-muffin:\n    serve(m)\ncase h := <-hash:\n    serve(h)\n}\n",
  ["___(ch)\nx, ok := <-ch          // ok is false after\n"] = "___(ch)\nx, ok := <-ch          // その後 ok は false\n",
  ["___(floors)                  // len(floors) == 0 after\n"] = "___(floors)                  // 実行後 len(floors) == 0\n",
  ['___(prices, "closed")\n'] = '___(prices, "closed")\n',
  ['___, err := tap("octopus")\n'] = '___, err := tap("octopus")\n',
  ["a + b with no semicolon is the value of the block. Go coders write return; Rust coders usually do not."] = "セミコロンのない a + b がブロックの値。Go 使いは return を書くが、Rust 使いはふつう書かない。",
  ["a := []int{1, 2, 3}\nb := a[:2]\nb[0] = 9\nfmt.Println(a[0])       // prints ___\n"] = "a := []int{1, 2, 3}\nb := a[:2]\nb[0] = 9\nfmt.Println(a[0])       // ___ を出力\n",
  ["a to z. The array length is part of the type, so it must be a constant."] = "a から z まで。配列の長さは型の一部なので、定数でなければならない。",
  ["a.clone() allocates a second buffer. Cheap types derive Copy instead and never need it."] = "a.clone() は 2 つ目のバッファを確保する。軽い型は代わりに Copy を derive し、これを必要としない。",
  ["a[mid] is too small: the answer is to the right. Fill: lo = ___ + 1"] = "a[mid] が小さすぎる: 答えは右側。穴埋め: lo = ___ + 1",
  ["add changes qty. Which receiver borrows the order with write access?"] = "add は qty を変える。書き込みアクセス付きで注文を借用するレシーバは？",
  ["arrows walk   ESC map"] = "矢印 移動   ESC 地図",
  ["as usize widens the u8 for free. A u8 index would not compile: Rust never converts integers silently."] = "as usize は u8 をタダで広げる。u8 の添字はコンパイルできない: Rust は整数を黙って変換しない。",
  ["as_ followed by the short word for reference. Its cousin as_deref goes one step further, to Option<&Node>."] = "as_ の後ろに、参照を意味する短い 3 文字。親戚の as_deref はもう一歩進んで Option<&Node> になる。",
  ["as_ref would give Option<&Box<T>>. This one also derefs the Box. as_ plus deref."] = "as_ref なら Option<&Box<T>> になる。こちらは Box もデリファレンスする。as_ に deref を足したもの。",
  ["async and tokio"] = "async と tokio",
  ["async fn eta(url: &str) -> Result<String, Box<dyn Error>> {\n    // GET, wait for headers, then wait for the body\n    let body = ___::get(url).await?.text().await?;\n    Ok(body)\n}\n"] = "async fn eta(url: &str) -> Result<String, Box<dyn Error>> {\n    // GET してヘッダを待ち、それから本文を待つ\n    let body = ___::get(url).await?.text().await?;\n    Ok(body)\n}\n",
  ["async fn fetch_eta(..) -> u32 really returns impl Future<Output = u32>. Nothing runs until polled."] = "async fn fetch_eta(..) -> u32 は実際には impl Future<Output = u32> を返す。poll されるまで何も動かない。",
  ['async fn plan() {\n    // suspends here; other tasks run while we wait\n    let eta = fetch_eta(7)___;\n    println!("rider back in {eta} min");\n}\n'] = 'async fn plan() {\n    // ここで中断。待っている間に他のタスクが動く\n    let eta = fetch_eta(7)___;\n    println!("rider back in {eta} min");\n}\n',
  ["async fn returns a Future; .await drives it. tokio runs them; spawn and join! run them at once."] = "async fn は Future を返し、.await が駆動する。tokio が動かす。spawn と join! で同時に走らせる。",
  ["b shares a's array. After b[0] = 9, what does a[0] print?"] = "b は a の配列を共有。b[0] = 9 のあと、a[0] は何を出力？",
  ['b, err := json.___(order)   // []byte\nfmt.Println(string(b))      // {"dish":"set"}\n'] = 'b, err := json.___(order)   // []byte\nfmt.Println(string(b))      // {"dish":"set"}\n',
  ["binary, underscore, search. Takes a reference to the wanted value. Err carries the insertion point."] = "binary、アンダースコア、search。探したい値への参照を取る。Err は挿入位置を運ぶ。",
  ["break leaves the innermost for, switch or select. A label breaks an outer one."] = "break は一番内側の for、switch、select を抜けます。ラベルで外側も抜けられます。",
  ["c - b'a' is a u8 from 0 to 25. Arrays are indexed by exactly one integer type. Cast to which?"] = "c - b'a' は 0 から 25 までの u8。配列の添字になれる整数型はただ 1 つ。どれにキャストする？",
  ["cap is the room in the backing array. append doubles it when len reaches cap."] = "cap は内部配列の余裕。len が cap に達すると append が倍にします。",
  ["cargo add serde --features derive writes the line for you and picks the newest version."] = "cargo add serde --features derive が行を書いてくれて、最新バージョンを選ぶ。",
  ["cargo clippy is the linter; -- -D warnings makes CI fail on any lint. The crab approves."] = "cargo clippy がリンター。-- -D warnings で CI はどんな lint でも失敗にする。カニも納得。",
  ["cargo fmt rewrites in place; --check only reports. Build green, lint clean. Ticket six closed."] = "cargo fmt はその場で書き換える。--check は報告だけ。ビルドは緑、lint はきれい。チケット6完了。",
  ["cargo new makes Cargo.toml, src/main.rs and a git repo. cargo init does it in an existing folder."] = "cargo new は Cargo.toml、src/main.rs、git リポジトリを作る。cargo init は既存フォルダで同じことをする。",
  ["cargo new, add, build --release, test, clippy, fmt. Cargo.toml asks, Cargo.lock pins."] = "cargo new、add、build --release、test、clippy、fmt。Cargo.toml が要求し、Cargo.lock が固定する。",
  ["cargo run. cargo new makes a project, cargo build compiles, cargo test runs tests. The kiosk boots."] = "cargo run。cargo new でプロジェクト作成、cargo build でコンパイル、cargo test でテスト実行。キオスクが起動する。",
  ["cargo test builds a test binary and runs #[test] fns in parallel. cargo test name filters."] = "cargo test はテストバイナリを作り、#[test] の関数を並列に走らせる。cargo test name で絞り込める。",
  ["ch := make(___)        // unbuffered\n"] = "ch := make(___)        // バッファなし\n",
  ["ch := make(chan int)\nch <- 1                // nobody receives\nfmt.Println(<-ch)\n// fatal error: all goroutines are asleep - ___!\n"] = "ch := make(chan int)\nch <- 1                // 誰も受信しない\nfmt.Println(<-ch)\n// fatal error: all goroutines are asleep - ___!\n",
  ['ch := make(chan string)\nch ___ "muffin"        // send\n'] = 'ch := make(chan string)\nch ___ "muffin"        // 送信\n',
  ['ch := make(chan string, ___)   // buffered\nch <- "muffin"                 // does not block yet\n'] = 'ch := make(chan string, ___)   // バッファあり\nch <- "muffin"                 // まだブロックしない\n',
  ["ch <- x sends. x := <-ch receives. Same operator, different place."] = "ch <- x が送信。x := <-ch が受信。同じ演算子、違う位置。",
  ["chan is a typed pipe. <- sends and receives. close tells receivers to stop."] = "chan は型付きパイプ。<- で送受信。close で受信側に終了を伝えます。",
  ["chan struct{} plus close is the cheapest done signal. context.Done() returns one."] = "chan struct{} と close が最も安価な完了シグナル。context.Done() もこれを返します。",
  ["chars().count() walks the string and counts. The receipt prints 銅鑼灣 in full."] = "chars().count() は文字列を歩いて数える。レシートに 銅鑼灣 が全部印字された。",
  ["cheapest := ___(muffin, hash, coffee)   // built-in\n"] = "cheapest := ___(muffin, hash, coffee)   // 組み込み\n",
  ["clear(m) deletes every key. Before 1.21 you looped with delete."] = "clear(m) は全キーを削除。1.21 より前は delete でループしていました。",
  ["close(ch). range ch stops when the channel is closed."] = "close(ch)。range ch は channel が閉じると止まります。",
  ["close(jobs) is the shutdown signal: every worker's range loop drains and exits."] = "close(jobs) が終了の合図: 各 worker の range ループが残りを処理して抜けます。",
  ["collect::<Vec<_>>() or let v: Vec<_> = ...collect(). Iterators are lazy until then."] = "collect::<Vec<_>>() か let v: Vec<_> = ...collect()。それまでイテレータは遅延する。",
  ["comparable for map keys and ==. any allows everything but promises nothing."] = "map のキーと == には comparable。any は全てを許すが何も保証しません。",
  ["const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n"] = "const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n",
  ["const OPEN: u8 = 7; A const always has a type, never mut. u8 holds 0 to 255."] = "const OPEN: u8 = 7; const には必ず型があり、mut にはならない。u8 は 0 から 255 まで。",
  ["const opens = 6. The lift knows when breakfast starts."] = "const opens = 6。エレベーターは朝食の時間を知っています。",
  ["contains, underscore, key. Returns bool. Its cousin get would return the index directly."] = "contains、アンダースコア、key。bool を返す。親戚の get ならインデックスを直接返す。",
  ["context carries deadlines and cancel. go test runs Test* in _test.go."] = "context は期限とキャンセルを運びます。go test は _test.go の Test* を実行します。",
  ["context.Background() then WithCancel. Always defer cancel()."] = "context.Background() の後に WithCancel。必ず defer cancel() を。",
  ["continue skips one round; break ends the loop."] = "continue は1回飛ばし、break はループを終えます。",
  ["count must go up. Which word after let allows the change?"] = "count は増えなければならない。let の後ろに置くと変更を許す単語は？",
  ["ctx := context.___()\nctx, cancel := context.WithCancel(ctx)\ndefer cancel()\n"] = "ctx := context.___()\nctx, cancel := context.WithCancel(ctx)\ndefer cancel()\n",
  ["ctx, cancel := context.___(ctx, 2*time.Second)\ndefer cancel()          // always\n"] = "ctx, cancel := context.___(ctx, 2*time.Second)\ndefer cancel()          // 必ず\n",
  ["ctx.Done() closes on cancel or deadline; ctx.Err() says which one."] = "ctx.Done() はキャンセルか期限で閉じ、ctx.Err() がどちらかを教えます。",
  ["default: runs when every channel would block. The till stays free."] = "default: は全 channel がブロックする時に実行。レジは空いたままです。",
  ["defer captures its arguments now, not later. What does this print?"] = "defer は引数を後ではなく今キャプチャします。何が出力される？",
  ["defer evaluates arguments immediately. defer func() { fmt.Println(x) }() would print 2."] = "defer は引数を即座に評価します。defer func() { fmt.Println(x) }() なら 2 が出ます。",
  ["defer f.Close(). The drawer shuts even if Pay fails."] = "defer f.Close()。Pay が失敗しても引き出しは閉まります。",
  ["defer func() {\n    if r := ___(); r != nil {\n        // saved the till\n    }\n}()\n"] = "defer func() {\n    if r := ___(); r != nil {\n        // レジを救った\n    }\n}()\n",
  ["delete(m, k) removes it. Maps grow by assignment, shrink by this."] = "delete(m, k) で削除。map は代入で増え、これで減ります。",
  ["delete(m, key). Safe if the key is already gone."] = "delete(m, key)。キーがすでに無くても安全です。",
  ["derive Serialize and Deserialize, then serde_json::to_string and from_str. Attributes shape the JSON."] = "Serialize と Deserialize を derive し、serde_json::to_string と from_str。属性で JSON の形を決める。",
  ["derive(Serialize, Deserialize) needs the derive feature in Cargo.toml. serde_json does the format."] = "derive(Serialize, Deserialize) には Cargo.toml の derive フィーチャが必要。フォーマットは serde_json が担当。",
  ["done := make(chan ___)   // zero bytes per value\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n"] = "done := make(chan ___)   // 1値あたり 0 バイト\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n",
  ["drop(tray) takes ownership and frees it. Normally the closing brace of the scope does this. No GC needed."] = "drop(tray) は所有権を受け取って解放する。ふだんはスコープの閉じ波かっこがこれをやる。GC はいらない。",
  ["drop(tx) runs Drop now. tx2 is dropped when its thread ends; with both gone, rx sees the end and the for loop stops."] = "drop(tx) は今すぐ Drop を走らせる。tx2 はそのスレッドが終わると drop される。両方消えれば rx は終端を見て、for ループが止まる。",
  ["drop(tx): the channel closes when the last Sender is gone. Queued jobs are still delivered first. Forget this and join waits forever."] = "drop(tx): 最後の Sender が消えるとチャネルが閉じる。並んでいるジョブは先に届けられる。これを忘れると join が永遠に待つ。",
  ['drop(tx);\n// wait for each cook; unwrap re-raises a panic from it\nfor h in handles {\n    h.___().unwrap();\n}\nprintln!("kitchen closed");\n'] = 'drop(tx);\n// 料理人ごとに待つ。unwrap はそこで起きた panic を投げ直す\nfor h in handles {\n    h.___().unwrap();\n}\nprintln!("kitchen closed");\n',
  ["drop, then join, in that order. Seven rounds, no misses, combo x7. The screen says HIRED and the crab on the kiosk waves."] = "drop、それから join、その順で。7 ラウンド、ミスなし、コンボ x7。画面に HIRED と出て、キオスクのカニが手を振る。",
  ["entry(a).or_default() returns &mut Vec<u32>, so push works in one line. One hash lookup, not two."] = "entry(a).or_default() は &mut Vec<u32> を返すので、push が 1 行で書ける。ハッシュ検索は 2 回でなく 1 回。",
  ["entry(k).or_insert(0) returns &mut to the value; * dereferences it. get(k) returns Option, so a missing key is None, not a panic."] = "entry(k).or_insert(0) は値への &mut を返し、* で参照外しする。get(k) は Option を返すので、ないキーは panic ではなく None。",
  ["enum OrderError lists every failure. Debug is required by the Error trait later."] = "enum OrderError が失敗を全部並べる。Debug はあとで Error トレイトに必要になる。",
  ["enum Size { Small, Large } Variants can carry data too, like Some(12). match without a Medium arm is a compile error, not a bug at the till."] = "enum Size { Small, Large } バリアントは Some(12) のようにデータも持てる。Medium のアームが抜けた match はレジで起きるバグではなく、コンパイルエラーになる。",
  ['enum State { Queued, Cooking, Riding, Done }\n// a pattern test that returns true or false\nlet busy = ___!(state, State::Cooking | State::Riding);\nif busy { println!("not yet"); }\n'] = 'enum State { Queued, Cooking, Riding, Done }\n// true か false を返すパターン判定\nlet busy = ___!(state, State::Cooking | State::Riding);\nif busy { println!("not yet"); }\n',
  ["enumerate() gives (index, item). zip(prices) would give (dish, price). No off-by-one."] = "enumerate() は (index, item) を返す。zip(prices) なら (dish, price)。1ずれのバグなし。",
  ["error is an interface. Check err != nil. defer runs when the function returns."] = "error は interface です。err != nil を確認。defer は関数の return 時に実行されます。",
  ["error is interface{ Error() string }. Your own types can carry data."] = "error は interface{ Error() string }。自作の型にデータを持たせられます。",
  ["errors.As finds the first error of that type and stores it in re."] = "errors.As はその型の最初の error を見つけて re に格納します。",
  ["errors.Is compares values down the chain. Use it instead of ==."] = "errors.Is はチェーンをたどって値を比較します。== の代わりに使いましょう。",
  ["errors.New for fixed messages; name them ErrSomething at package level."] = "固定メッセージには errors.New。パッケージレベルで ErrSomething と名付けます。",
  ["errors.New makes one. %w wraps one. errors.Is and errors.As search the chain."] = "errors.New で作り、%w でラップ。errors.Is と errors.As でチェーンを探します。",
  ["expect(msg) panics with msg on Err. Use it for real bugs, not for user input. The till is back; Siu Ming exhales."] = "expect(msg) は Err のとき msg を出して panic する。本当のバグに使い、ユーザー入力には使わない。レジが復活。シウミンが息をつく。",
  ['f, err := os.Open("order.txt")\n___ f.Close()\n'] = 'f, err := os.Open("order.txt")\n___ f.Close()\n',
  ["fetch, underscore, then the arithmetic you want."] = "fetch、アンダースコア、そしてやりたい算術。",
  ["fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst) adds and returns the old value atomically. SeqCst is the strictest, simplest ordering."] = "fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst) はアトミックに足して古い値を返す。SeqCst は最も厳しく、最も単純な順序付け。",
  ["fib(40) naively is a billion calls. Look the answer up first. Which HashMap method?"] = "素直に書いた fib(40) は 10 億回の呼び出し。まず答えを引こう。HashMap のどのメソッド？",
  ["fib(n) = fib(n-1) + the one before that. The base case n < 2 guarantees this never underflows."] = "fib(n) = fib(n-1) + そのひとつ前。基底ケース n < 2 が、下限を割らないことを保証する。",
  ["filter keeps items where the closure is true. It is lazy until collect pulls."] = "filter はクロージャが true の要素だけ残す。collect が引っ張るまで遅延する。",
  ["filter, map, collect: the chain is lazy until collect. Collecting once lets us iterate twice, forwards and rev."] = "filter、map、collect: collect まで連鎖は遅延する。一度集めておけば、前からと rev の 2 回まわせる。",
  ["first() gives an Option. Return None early if the order is empty. Which operator?"] = "first() は Option を返す。注文が空なら早めに None を返す。どの演算子？",
  ["fmt prints a type your way if it has one method. Fill: func (o Order) ___() string"] = "メソッドを1つ持てば fmt は型を好きな形で出力します。埋める: func (o Order) ___() string",
  ['fmt.___(w, "served %s", item)   // w is an io.Writer\n'] = 'fmt.___(w, "served %s", item)   // w は io.Writer\n',
  ["fn add(&mut self, n: u32). Self with a capital S names the type itself, handy in fn new() -> Self."] = "fn add(&mut self, n: u32)。大文字 S の Self は型そのものを指し、fn new() -> Self で便利。",
  ["fn add_edge(g: &mut Graph, a: u32, b: u32) {\n    // no list for a yet? start an empty one, then push b\n    g.entry(a).___().push(b);\n    // the long spelling of the same thing, other direction\n    g.entry(b).or_insert_with(Vec::new).push(a);\n}\n"] = "fn add_edge(g: &mut Graph, a: u32, b: u32) {\n    // a のリストがまだない？ 空のを作って b を push\n    g.entry(a).___().push(b);\n    // 同じことの長い書き方、逆向き\n    g.entry(b).or_insert_with(Vec::new).push(a);\n}\n",
  ['fn assign(order: &Order) {\n    // Rust 1.65: a refutable pattern with a fallback block\n    let Some(rider) = pick_rider(order) ___ { return };\n    println!("{rider} takes order {}", order.id);\n}\n'] = 'fn assign(order: &Order) {\n    // Rust 1.65: 失敗しうるパターンに逃げ道のブロックを付ける\n    let Some(rider) = pick_rider(order) ___ { return };\n    println!("{rider} takes order {}", order.id);\n}\n',
